<title>GERMANY: FAG Kugelfischer to raise 96 dividend.</title>
<headline>FAG Kugelfischer to raise 96 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German ballbearing manufacturer FAG Kugelfischer Georg Schaefer AG said on Tuesday it would propose raising its 1996 dividend to 50 pfennigs per share from 40 pfennigs.</p>
<p>The proposal is subject to approval by the company's supervisory board, which meets on April 23.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
